{"id":"118222","name":"菜谱","author":"耕心","authorId":"6440953","desc":"","cover":"images/118222/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大白菜","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"冷开水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：大白菜、菌粉、食盐和葡萄糖。","img":"images/118222/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将大白菜的根部切去，择洗干净，沥干。","img":"images/118222/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切半。","img":"images/118222/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切丝。","img":"images/118222/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"焯烫一下。","img":"images/118222/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"沥干，摊凉。","img":"images/118222/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入容器内。","img":"images/118222/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入发酵汁，直到发酵汁没过白菜。","img":"images/118222/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放置在机器内，用压菜板压实白菜。","img":"images/118222/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将内胆上盖盖好，扣好锁扣。","img":"images/118222/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖好盖，通电，按开关。","img":"images/118222/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"选择酸菜功能键。","img":"images/118222/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"小时，时间到，即可断电。","img":"images/118222/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"白菜切丝可加速腌制成熟速度。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他、食物调理机\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}